{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026MJcpFgCrb41795419170.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受東北季候風影響，本港明日逐步轉涼。天文台預測周三、周四，市區氣溫最低16度。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1530.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DbKlAIgpOS1795418942.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>在中環海濱風勢清勁，市民和旅客穿上厚外套、毛衣保暖。受東北季候風及一道廣闊雲帶影響，明日廣東沿岸地區有雨，隨後一兩天早晚清涼。周三、周四市區最低降至16度，新界再低兩、三度。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1530_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ScVAqgCHFk1795419187.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>隨著東北季候風緩和及雲帶轉薄，本周後期天色逐漸好轉，氣溫又再回升。預料一股較乾燥的東北季候風補充，會在周末影響華南沿岸，屆時日夜溫差頗大。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.689467+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T07:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:57:11.816417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:47:28.515996+00:00","content_hash":"df113d0f98a0c481a1fd644cf73129835991e0a861935faf9f3d1661d0ff177f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.689467+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}